      ro: ["Foshan este considerat locul de origine al È™colilor de arte marÈ›iale sudice (Wing Chun È™i Hung Gar).", "Cuptorul Nanfeng a fost construit Ã®n 1506 È™i este cel mai vechi cuptor de ceramicÄƒ funcÈ›ional din lume.", "Templul StrÄƒmoÈ™ilor (Zumiao) este dedicat zeitÄƒÈ›ii Beidi, protectorul apelor È™i al sudului.", "Foshan produce aproximativ o treime din totalul aparatelor electrocasnice la nivel mondial.", "OraÈ™ul este faimos pentru dansul leului, inclus Ã®n patrimoniul cultural imaterial Ã®n 2006.", "Foshan este conectat de Guangzhou prin prima linie de metrou interurbanÄƒ din China (Linia Guangfo)."],
      en: ["Foshan is recognized as the cradle of southern Chinese martial arts, including Wing Chun and Hung Gar.", "The Nanfeng Kiln was built in 1506 and is the world's oldest ceramic kiln still in use today.", "The Ancestral Temple (Zumiao) is dedicated to Beidi, the Northern God and protector of the region.", "Foshan accounts for approximately one-third of the global production of household appliances.", "The city is a center for the traditional lion dance, designated as national intangible heritage.", "Foshan is linked to Guangzhou by the Guangfo Line, China's first intercity subway system."],
